    {
      "heading_level": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "4 Training data",
        "Cell-Line Genomics &amp; Protein Facts (DepMap [DepMap, 2024, Pacini et al., 2024], Cellosaurus [Bairoch, 2018], UniProt [The UniProt Consortium, 2025]): Tasks linking expression profiles of cancer cell lines to copy-number alterations, mutated cancer genes, oncogenes, tumor suppressors, disease, lineage, and anatomical site, together with protein questions covering subcellular locations, protein functions, and enzymatic properties."
